{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgfhQJTmhiH7E9FXySzuV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Setup.** For tetrahedral d⁷ the ground term is ⁴A₂. The three spin-allowed bands are:\n\n- ν₁ = ⁴T₂(F) ← ⁴A₂\n- ν₂ = ⁴T₁(F) ← ⁴A₂\n- ν₃ = ⁴T₁(P) ← ⁴A₂\n\nThe energy matrices are the same as for octahedral d³ (the hole formalism). Here Dq is the tetrahedral value, and ν₁ = 10Dq exactly.\n\nThe two ⁴T₁ levels mix. Measured from ⁴A₂, they are the eigenvalues of\n\n[[18Dq, 4B], [4B, 15B + 6Dq]]\n\nSo ν₂ + ν₃ = 24Dq + 15B, and ν₂·ν₃ = 18Dq(15B + 6Dq) − 16B².\n\n**Solution from ν₂ and ν₃.** I solved the two equations without using ν₁.\n\n- The sum gives 24Dq + 15B = 26 160.\n- The product gives 7520 × 18 640 = 1.402 × 10⁸.\n- Substituting B = 1744 − 1.6Dq into the product equation gives a quadratic in Dq. Its physical root is Dq ≈ 500 cm⁻¹, so B ≈ 944 cm⁻¹.\n\n**Check against ν₁.** These values predict ν₁ = 10Dq ≈ 5000 cm⁻¹. The observed band is at 4330 cm⁻¹, about 670 cm⁻¹ lower, which is a modest mismatch.\n\nFixing Dq = 433 cm⁻¹ from ν₁ instead makes the ν₂ and ν₃ fit worse. It gives B ≈ 1050 cm⁻¹ and predicts ν₂ ≈ 6330 and ν₃ ≈ 19 830 cm⁻¹, each off by about 1200 cm⁻¹. I therefore take the ν₂/ν₃ solution as the best three-band description. I did not run a numerical least-squares fit over all three bands, so the values are approximate.\n\n**Result.** Dq ≈ 500 cm⁻¹ (Δₜ ≈ 5000 cm⁻¹) and B ≈ 944 cm⁻¹. This is about 97% of the free-ion value for Co²⁺ (≈ 971 cm⁻¹), which suggests little covalency. The model does not determine C.\n\n{\"Dq\": 500, \"B\": 944, \"C\": null, \"out_of_scope\": false, \"reason\": \"Tetrahedral d7 solved via the d3-equivalent 4T1(F)/4T1(P) matrix using ν2 and ν3; ν1 is reproduced only approximately (5000 vs 4330 cm-1).\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7974,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7974,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b6113a4d-a6a7-41c7-a3ba-31e240625079","uuid":"c9ca9b04-5925-4c79-9abe-75e1e41da3b7","timestamp":"2026-11-03T08:42:38.088Z","request_id":"req_011CgfhQJ7Bg48C5a84wUQKP"}
